---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Articles — Stable or Gone';
const description = 'Source-backed analysis of stablecoin launches, institutions, regulation, market structure, and lifecycle developments.';
const canonicalPath = '/articles/';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath={canonicalPath}>
  <section class="panel registry">
    <div class="bar">Articles</div>
    <h1>Stablecoin developments, separated from the registry</h1>
    <p>These articles explain material developments that may matter to the stablecoin market but are not, by publication alone, canonical Stable or Gone records. Confirmed facts, unresolved questions, and analysis are kept separate.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="panel registry">
    <div class="bar">September 2, 2026</div>
    <h2><a href="/articles/21-financial-institutions-joint-stablecoin-venture/">21 Financial Institutions Plan Joint Stablecoin Venture, Targeting USD Launch in H1 2027</a></h2>
    <p>MUFG, Goldman Sachs, Bank of America, Citi and other institutions have committed to establish a new company. What is confirmed, what remains unknown, and why the plan matters for bank deposits, reserve economics and competition with existing stablecoins.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
